## E. Output Template

Use this template for both ADR and PR mode. Replace `{MODE}` markers as appropriate.

**Mandatory deliverable rules:**

- **Save path:** PR → `output/test-plan-pr-<PR-NUMBER>.md`; ADR → `output/test-plan-<feature-slug>.md`.
- **Checklist required:** Every saved plan MUST include `## Quality Gate Checklist` (gates 1–17 from Section F) with Pass/Fail and one-line evidence per gate.
- **Revise until Pass:** Update the plan file until every gate is **Pass**; do not save a final plan with any Fail.
- **E2E after plan:** Do not implement or update `test/e2e/` until the saved plan checklist shows all gates Pass (see Quick Start).

